  ('grey-heron', 'Grey Heron', 'Ardea cinerea', 'birds', 'A tall grey wading bird that stands motionless in shallows before striking at fish.', 'Rivers, lakes, ponds and coastal shores', 'Year-round; check water margins at dawn'),
  ('red-kite', 'Red Kite', 'Milvus milvus', 'birds', 'A large raptor with a forked reddish tail and long angled wings, once nearly lost from Britain and now returning.', 'Farmland, woodland edges and valleys', 'Year-round; soaring on sunny, breezy days'),
