  ('red-deer', 'Red Deer', 'Cervus elaphus', 'land-mammals', 'The largest wild land mammal in the UK, famed for its autumn rut.', 'Highland glens, moorland and woodland', 'October for the rut; otherwise dawn and dusk'),
